      "representative_length": 389,
      "representative_excerpt": "He bets $1 at a time and at most doubles down. He has \u201cwon\u201d $16000 in bets. He has lost $15975 for net winnings of $25. He will be able to deduct $15975 x .90 IF HE ITEMIZES\u201d . So net income for tax purposes is $1623. So he will pay about $400 in income taxes for his net winnings of $25. If he doesn\u2019t itemize, he will pay about $4000. This is crazy....",
