      "representative_excerpt": "Please change this new rule. Taxes should only be on real income, not \"phantom\" income. This hurts everyone who wants to enjoy placing a legal wager and I no longer participate in a fun hobby because of this change. Ultimately this raises less money than more for the IRS. Suggest rethinking.",
